{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Have grace on me</b> — Because R. Moses ha-Kohen found: אמלל פתח. He said that it is not a nomen adiectivum but is deficient, like ונאשאר אני, whose correct form is ונשארתי, in the manner of אני הגבר ראה עני, הנני יוסיף על ימיך. And the matter is correct." "<b>My bones are dismayed</b> — For they are the foundation of the body, and they do not feel, yet as though they felt, from the weight of the illness. And behold, עצמי stands in contrast to the body."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {0 "'אמלל פתח' appears to be a technical notation from R. Moses ha-Kohen's work, possibly a manuscript heading or section reference; rendered exactly as found without expansion."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:31.220673191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}